OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order 'won't make deals' to
OL,4,Asolve Drumcree dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Orange Order in Portadown has
OL,7,Finsisted it will not make any deals to
OL,8,Ftry to walk down the Garvaghy Road.
OL,10,FPortadown District Master Nigel Dawson
OL,11,Fspoke after a meeting at Carleton
OL,12,FStreet Orange Hall in the town, which
OL,13,Flasted two and a half hours.
OL,15,FThe order plans to apply for another
OL,16,FDrumcree parade after restrictions
OL,17,Fimposed on its planned parade last
OL,18,Fmonth were quashed in court.
OL,20,FIt said it will make a significant
OL,21,Fannouncement about this on Thursday
OL,22,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
